---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Knock cutover: sequences are not replicated. Numbers illustrative.
---
<figure class="rf">
  <div class="rf-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 360" role="img" aria-label="Logical replication copies the rows of the orders table to the new Postgres 15.3 server but not the ID counter. The new counter still starts at 1, so without a fix the next insert would reuse an ID that already exists. Setting the counter to the old value plus 100,000 before cutover makes the next ID 1,334,568.">
    <rect x="20" y="24" width="320" height="112" rx="4" class="box strong" />
    <DiagramIcon name="postgres" x={300} y={24} size={28} />
    <text x="36" y="52" class="t-h"><tspan data-lang-en>Old primary (11.9)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Primary cũ (11.9)</tspan></text>
    <text x="36" y="78" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>orders rows: ids up to 1,234,566</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>dòng orders: id tới 1.234.566</tspan></text>
    <text x="36" y="100" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>orders_id_seq, next id: 1,234,567</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>orders_id_seq, id kế tiếp: 1.234.567</tspan></text>
    <line x1="342.0" y1="80.0" x2="549.0" y2="80.0" class="edge " /><polygon points="558.0,80.0 549.0,75.5 549.0,84.5" class="head " />
    <text x="450" y="62" text-anchor="middle" class="t-b"><tspan data-lang-en>rows are copied</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>dòng được chép</tspan></text>
    <text x="450" y="102" text-anchor="middle" class="t-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>the counter is not</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bộ đếm thì không</tspan></text>
    <rect x="560" y="24" width="320" height="112" rx="4" class="box strong" />
    <DiagramIcon name="postgres" x={840} y={24} size={28} />
    <text x="576" y="52" class="t-h"><tspan data-lang-en>New server (15.3)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Server mới (15.3)</tspan></text>
    <text x="576" y="78" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>orders rows: same ids copied</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>dòng orders: các id đã chép</tspan></text>
    <text x="576" y="100" class="t-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>orders_id_seq, next id: 1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>orders_id_seq, id kế tiếp: 1</tspan></text>
    <line x1="660.0" y1="138.0" x2="238.9" y2="192.8" class="edge bad" /><polygon points="230.0,194.0 239.5,197.3 238.3,188.4" class="head bad" />
    <line x1="740.0" y1="138.0" x2="696.0" y2="187.3" class="edge ok" /><polygon points="690.0,194.0 699.4,190.3 692.6,184.3" class="head ok" />
    <rect x="20" y="196" width="420" height="138" rx="4" class="box bad" />
    <DiagramIcon name="fail" x={60} y={236} size={30} />
    <text x="100" y="230" class="t-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>Without a fix</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Không xử lý</tspan></text>
    <text x="100" y="254" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>the next insert gets id 1,</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>insert kế tiếp nhận id 1,</tspan></text>
    <text x="100" y="273" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>which already exists</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>đã tồn tại từ trước</tspan></text>
    <text x="100" y="292" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>in the copied rows</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>trong các dòng đã chép</tspan></text>
    <rect x="460" y="196" width="420" height="138" rx="4" class="box ok" />
    <DiagramIcon name="ok" x={500} y={236} size={30} />
    <text x="540" y="230" class="t-ok"><tspan data-lang-en>Before cutover: set it ahead</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Trước khi chuyển: đặt vượt lên</tspan></text>
    <text x="540" y="256" class="t-mono">setval(old next value + 100,000)</text>
    <text x="540" y="282" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>the next insert gets id 1,334,568,</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>insert kế tiếp nhận id 1.334.568,</tspan></text>
    <text x="540" y="301" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>clear of every copied row</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>không đụng dòng đã chép nào</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Rows travel through logical replication; the counter does not. Setting it ahead before cutover keeps new IDs clear of old ones. The numbers come from the simplified SQL above.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Các dòng dữ liệu đi qua logical replication; bộ đếm thì không. Đặt nó vượt lên trước khi chuyển giúp ID mới không đụng ID cũ. Các con số lấy từ đoạn SQL rút gọn ở trên.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .rf { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .rf-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .rf svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .rf text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .rf .t-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-hs { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-b { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-note { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .rf .t-mono { font-size: 12px; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-bad { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
  .rf .t-ok { fill: var(--text); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
  .rf .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .rf .box.strong { stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.bad { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.ok { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.empty { fill: none; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .rf .box.bad.empty { fill: none; }
  .rf .edge { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; fill: none; }
  .rf .edge.dash { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .rf .edge.bad { stroke: var(--red); stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .rf .edge.ok { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .rf .head.bad { fill: var(--red); }
  .rf .head.ok { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .rf figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
